---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects" description="Applied research, analytical tools and experiments in public value">
  <div class="section-page">
    <h1>Projects</h1>
    <p class="intro">Applied research, analytical tools and experiments focused on evidence, implementation and the active management of public value.</p>

    <div class="project-grid">
      <article class="project-card featured">
        <div class="card-topline">
          <span class="project-type">Public-source evidence project</span>
          <span class="project-date">August 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h2><a href={`${base}projects/rewiring-the-state-evidence/`}>Rewiring the State: what should implementation watch?</a></h2>
        <p>Given the stated direction of travel, this project maps the expected-benefit pathways behind devolution and institutional reform, where public evidence is stronger or weaker, and what implementation should monitor as benefits develop.</p>
        <div class="tags" aria-label="Topics">
          <span>Active benefits management</span>
          <span>Devolution</span>
          <span>Public value</span>
        </div>
        <a class="read-link" href={`${base}projects/rewiring-the-state-evidence/`}>Explore the evidence <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="project-card featured">
        <div class="card-topline">
          <span class="project-type">Rapid evidence assessment</span>
          <span class="project-date">August 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h2><a href={`${base}projects/when-targeting-need-is-not-enough/`}>When targeting need is not enough</a></h2>
        <p>Need is an essential equity criterion, but not a complete allocation rule. This project examines how mechanism, readiness, additionality and expected marginal value can complement need when managing public investment.</p>
        <div class="tags" aria-label="Topics">
          <span>Place-based policy</span>
          <span>Public value</span>
          <span>Prevention</span>
        </div>
        <a class="read-link" href={`${base}projects/when-targeting-need-is-not-enough/`}>Read the project <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section-page{max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:3rem 2rem}.section-page h1{margin-bottom:1rem;font-size:2.5rem}.intro{color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.project-grid{display:grid;gap:1.25rem}.project-card{padding:1.6rem;background:var(--bg-secondary);border-radius:18px;border:1px solid var(--border);box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(20,32,51,.07)}.project-card.featured{border-top:4px solid var(--accent)}.card-topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem;color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:.82rem}.project-type{color:var(--accent);font-weight:750;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.project-card h2{font-size:1.65rem;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 .75rem}.project-card h2 a,.read-link{color:var(--text-primary);text-decoration:none}.project-card h2 a:hover,.read-link:hover{color:var(--accent)}.project-card p{color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.65}.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin:1.25rem 0}.tags span{padding:.35rem .65rem;border-radius:999px;background:var(--accent-soft);color:var(--accent);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:650}.read-link{display:inline-block;font-weight:750}@media(max-width:768px){.section-page{padding:2rem 1rem}.section-page h1{font-size:1.75rem}.card-topline{flex-direction:column;gap:.35rem}}
</style>